==Catalan==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|ca}} {{term|planeta||planet|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc|ca}} {{term|sc=polytonic|πλανήτης|tr=planētēs|lang=grc}} variant of {{term|sc=polytonic|πλάνης|tr=planēs||wanderer, planet|lang=grc}}.

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|mf|planetes}}

# {{m}} [[planet]]
# {{f}} [[destiny]]; [[fate]]

====Usage notes====
Originally this noun was feminine in all senses, but in modern Catalan, the sense of planet is now masculine, taking masculine articles and adjectives, but the plural is still formed as if it were feminine for all senses.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|destiny}} {{l|ca|destí}}

